[h,u^i*v^k]=(k-3i)u^i*v^(k+2), whose distinct input monomials have distinct
output monomials, so ker[h,-]=Q[h].

Choose the polynomial references and remainders

a(R)=R^21,
b(R)=R^35+s^60*R^20,
F=s^79*R*u,
q(R)=(5/3)*R^14,
rho(R)=20*s^60*R^19,
G=(20/21)*s^139*u.

